<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Parakeet Café · 2027 Sales Objectives: A Second Look</title>
<style>
@font-face{font-family:"Monarcha";src:url("assets/Monarcha-Bold.otf") format("opentype");font-weight:100 900}
@font-face{font-family:"Playfair Display";src:url("assets/PlayfairDisplay-400.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:400;font-style:normal}
@font-face{font-family:"Playfair Display";src:url("assets/PlayfairDisplay-400i.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:400;font-style:italic}
@font-face{font-family:"Playfair Display";src:url("assets/PlayfairDisplay-700.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:700;font-style:normal}
@font-face{font-family:"Playfair Display";src:url("assets/PlayfairDisplay-900.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:900;font-style:normal}
@font-face{font-family:"Josefin Sans";src:url("assets/JosefinSans-400.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:400}
@font-face{font-family:"Josefin Sans";src:url("assets/JosefinSans-500.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:500}
@font-face{font-family:"Josefin Sans";src:url("assets/JosefinSans-600.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:600}
@font-face{font-family:"Josefin Sans";src:url("assets/JosefinSans-700.woff2") format("woff2");font-weight:700}

:root{
  --pink:#ef4b81;--pink-soft:#f59ab8;--ink:#000;--paper:#fff;
  --g900:#373a3c;--g700:#565a5c;--g500:#82888a;--g400:#b0b3b4;--g300:#ccc;--g100:#eceeef;--g50:#f2f2f2;
  --soft:rgba(221,221,221,.6);
  --display:"Monarcha","Playfair Display",serif;
  --body:"Playfair Display",Georgia,serif;
  --sans:"Josefin Sans","Helvetica Neue",sans-serif;
}
@page{size:13.333in 7.5in;margin:0}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}
body{font-family:var(--body);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:.2px;counter-reset:pg;
     -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
.page{width:13.333in;height:7.5in;padding:.4in .62in .62in;position:relative;overflow:hidden;break-after:page;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;counter-increment:pg}
.page:last-child{break-after:auto}
.page .pin-bottom{margin-top:auto}
.pn::after{content:counter(pg)}
svg{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}

/* chrome */
.head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}
.head img{height:20px;display:block}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:2.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g700)}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--pink);vertical-align:middle;margin:-3px 8px 0 0}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:27px;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:.5px;margin:16px 0 6px;max-width:11.9in}
h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--ink)}
.lede{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--g900);margin:2px 0 14px;max-width:11.6in}
.foot{position:absolute;left:.62in;right:.62in;bottom:.24in;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;
      font-family:var(--sans);font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:var(--g500);border-top:1px solid var(--soft);padding-top:6px}
.row{display:flex;gap:.4in}
.col{flex:1;min-width:0}
.pink{color:var(--pink)}
.muted{color:var(--g700)}
.note{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;color:var(--g500);letter-spacing:.2px;line-height:1.45}
.chart-title{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 4px}
.chart-sub{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;color:var(--g500);margin:0 0 6px}
.strip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:var(--g50);padding:11px 18px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}
.strip .lab{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}
b,strong{font-weight:700}

/* numbers */
.stat{border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:9px;margin-bottom:22px}
.stat.pinktop{border-top-color:var(--pink)}
.stat .lab{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--g700)}
.stat .val{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:34px;line-height:1.05;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.stat .cap{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;color:var(--g700);margin-top:4px}
.trio{display:flex;gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);margin-top:6px}
.trio .t{flex:1;padding:12px 18px 0 0}
.trio .t + .t{padding-left:20px;border-left:1px solid var(--soft)}
.trio .lab{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g700)}
.trio .big{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:46px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-top:8px}
.trio .t.budget .big{color:var(--g500)}
.trio .t.plan .big{color:var(--pink)}
.trio .cap{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--g700);margin-top:6px}

/* tables */
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
th{font-weight:600;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g700);text-align:right;padding:0 8px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);vertical-align:bottom;line-height:1.3}
td{padding:5px 8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft);white-space:nowrap}
th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left;padding-left:0}
td.l,th.l{text-align:left}
tr.total td{font-weight:700;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:none}
tr.sep td{border-top:1px solid var(--g300);padding-top:9px}
td.dim{color:var(--g500)}
table.roomy td{padding-top:7px;padding-bottom:7px}

/* badges (verdicts) */
.badge{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 8px 3px;border:1px solid;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2}
.badge.too_low{background:var(--pink);border-color:var(--pink);color:#fff}
.badge.slightly_low{color:var(--pink);border-color:var(--pink);background:#fff}
.badge.defensible{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);background:#fff}
.badge.in_line{background:var(--g100);border-color:var(--g100);color:var(--ink)}
.badge.above{background:var(--g700);border-color:var(--g700);color:#fff}
.badge.missing{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff}

/* findings */
.flist .finding{padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft)}
.flist .finding:first-child{padding-top:4px}
.flist .finding p{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6}
.score{border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:10px}
.score .slab{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px}
.score .s{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft);padding:18px 0 14px}
.score .k{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g700);grid-column:1/3}
.score .v{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:50px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-top:4px}
.score .g{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--g700);padding-bottom:6px}
.score .s.budget .v{color:var(--g500)}
.score .s.plan .v,.score .s.plan .g{color:var(--pink)}
.findings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px .45in;margin-top:22px}
.finding{display:flex;gap:14px}
.finding .num{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:22px;color:var(--pink);line-height:1;min-width:30px}
.finding p{margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55}

/* ledger (bridges) */
.ledger{width:100%;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px}
.ledger .r{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3.4in 1fr 1.1in;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft)}
.ledger .r .what{line-height:1.3}
.ledger .r .what small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--g500);letter-spacing:.2px;margin-top:2px}
.ledger .r .amt{text-align:right;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.ledger .r.tot{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.ledger .r.tot .what{font-weight:700}
.ledger .r.final .amt{color:var(--pink);font-size:17px}
.bar{height:14px;background:var(--g300)}
.ledger.compact .r{padding:7px 0;grid-template-columns:2.9in 1fr .9in;font-size:12px}
.bar.plus{background:var(--pink)}
.bar.minus{background:var(--g500)}
.bar.base{background:var(--g700)}
.bar.ours{background:var(--pink)}

/* callouts */
.callout{border-left:2px solid var(--pink);padding:2px 0 2px 16px}
.box{background:var(--g50);padding:16px 18px}
.box p{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55}
.box p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
ul.tight{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:17px}
ul.tight li{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5}
ul.tight.big li{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55}

/* cover & dividers */
.cover{padding:0;flex-direction:row}
.cover-left{width:55%;padding:.7in .6in .55in .75in;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.cover-left .logo{width:2.3in;display:block}
.cover-left .eyebrow{margin-top:.95in}
.cover-title{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:54px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:1px;margin:14px 0 18px}
.cover-sub{font-style:italic;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--g900);margin:0;max-width:5.6in}
.cover-meta{margin-top:auto;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:var(--g700);line-height:1.65;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:10px;max-width:5.9in}
.cover-right{width:45%;height:100%}
.cover-right img,.div-right img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}

.divider{padding:0;flex-direction:row}
.div-left{width:56%;padding:.75in .7in .6in .75in;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;position:relative}
.div-right{width:44%;height:100%}
.part{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pink)}
.div-title{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:50px;line-height:1.05;margin:12px 0 14px}
.div-sub{font-style:italic;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--g900);margin:0 0 26px;max-width:5.9in}
.div-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);max-width:5.9in}
.div-list li{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft);display:flex;gap:14px}
.div-list li span{color:var(--pink);font-weight:700;min-width:22px}
.divider .bird{position:absolute;width:1.05in;right:.45in;bottom:.5in}

/* café pages */
.cafe-tag{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
.cafe-tag .name{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
.cafe-tag + h1{margin-top:8px}
.side table td{padding:6px 8px}
.side .num-big{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
.walk{margin-top:14px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--g900)}
.walk div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft);padding:4px 0}
.walk div span:last-child{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}
.says h3{margin-bottom:4px}
.quote{font-style:italic;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--g900)}
.says p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55}
.minis{display:flex;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);margin-top:4px}
.minis .m{flex:1;padding:8px 10px 0 0}
.minis .m + .m{padding-left:12px;border-left:1px solid var(--soft)}
.minis .lab{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--g700);line-height:1.3}
.minis .val{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;margin-top:4px}
.minis .sub{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;color:var(--g500);margin-top:2px}
.verdict{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:11px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}
.verdict .badge{font-size:9.5px;padding:5px 10px 4px}
.method h3{margin-top:2px}
.method p{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 12px}
.method h3{margin-top:18px}
.method .col > h3:first-child{margin-top:2px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% set t = n.t %}{% set C = n.C %}
{% macro head(eyebrow) %}<div class="head"><img src="assets/logo-bird.png" alt="Parakeet Café"><span class="eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</span></div>{% endmacro %}
{% macro foot(note) %}<div class="foot"><span>Parakeet Café · 2027 Sales Objectives: A Second Look</span><span>{{ note }}</span><span class="pn"></span></div>{% endmacro %}
{% macro badge(v) %}<span class="badge {{ v }}">{{ VERDICT_LABEL[v] }}</span>{% endmacro %}
{% set SRC = "Toast POS net sales through Oct 14, 2026 · budget: “2027 Sales Objectives by Café – Investors”, Oct 2026" %}

{# ================================================================== 1 COVER #}
<section class="page cover">
  <div class="cover-left">
    <img class="logo" src="assets/logo-bird.png" alt="Parakeet Café">
    <div class="eyebrow">Budget review · October 2026</div>
    <div class="cover-title">2027 Sales<br>Objectives:<br>A Second Look</div>
    <p class="cover-sub">The 2026 finish holds up. The 2027 objectives assume our cafés stop growing. What four years of Toast sales say, café by café.</p>
    <div class="cover-meta">
      Reviewing “2027 Sales Objectives by Café – Investors” (prepared by the CFO, October 2026)<br>
      Toast POS net sales, {{ n.first_day.strftime("%B %Y") }} – {{ n.last_day.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") }} · prepared October 15, 2026
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-right"><img src="assets/hero-3.jpg" alt=""></div>
</section>

{# ================================================================== 2 SUMMARY #}
<section class="page">
  {{ head("The short version") }}
  <h1>2026 holds up. The 2027 objectives assume our cafés stop growing.</h1>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
    <div class="col flist" style="flex:1.5">
      <div class="finding"><div class="num">01</div><p><b>2026 holds up.</b> The budget's {{ t.b26 | fm }} finish for the nine cafés is within {{ t.d26 | apct }} of ours (Toast to September plus our October–December forecast) and within 2% café by café; {{ "%.0f" | format(t.booked_share * 100) }}% of the year is already booked. The one gap is scope: Nautilus ({{ C["Nautilus"].e26 | fm }}) is not in the budget.</p></div>
      <div class="finding"><div class="num">02</div><p><b>2027 assumes growth stops.</b> {{ t.bg | pct }} is about what the nine cafés would sell if they simply held their September level ({{ t.hold_lo | pct(0) }} to {{ t.hold_hi | pct(0) }}). They are growing {{ t.ytd_g | apct(0) }} this year and {{ t.oct_g | apct(0) }} in October.</p></div>
      <div class="finding"><div class="num">03</div><p><b>Five cafés carry most of the gap.</b> {{ n.strong.names[:-1] | join(", ") }} and {{ n.strong.names[-1] }} are growing {{ n.strong.ytd_lo | apct(0) }}–{{ n.strong.ytd_hi | apct(0) }} this year and are budgeted at {{ n.strong.bg_lo | apct(0) }}–{{ n.strong.bg_hi | apct(0) }}: {{ "%.0f" | format(n.strong.share * 100) }}% of the {{ t.gap | fm(1) }} gap between the budget and our plan.</p></div>
      <div class="finding"><div class="num">04</div><p><b>The budget is bolder than we are on new cafés.</b> Manhattan Beach and Sportsmen's Lodge are budgeted at {{ n.bridge27.new_budget | fm }}, {{ (n.bridge27.new_budget / n.bridge27.new_track - 1) | apct(0) }} more than an average opening of ours would bring ({{ n.bridge27.new_track | fm }}). We would also wait for the Cove remodel to trade before counting it.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col" style="flex:1">
      <div class="score">
        <div class="slab">2027 net sales · nine existing cafés</div>
        <div class="s budget"><div class="k">Budget</div><div class="v">{{ t.b27 | fm }}</div><div class="g">{{ t.bg | pct }}</div></div>
        <div class="s"><div class="k">What we suggest</div><div class="v">{{ n.suggest.nine | fm }}</div><div class="g">{{ (n.suggest.nine / t.e26 - 1) | pct }}</div></div>
        <div class="s plan"><div class="k">Our plan</div><div class="v">{{ t.plan27 | fm }}</div><div class="g">{{ t.pg | pct }}</div></div>
        <p class="note" style="margin-top:10px">Growth on each one's 2026 finish ({{ t.b26 | fm }} budget, {{ t.e26 | fm }} ours). What we suggest = our plan where the data backs it, the budget where it doesn't. Our plan = three forecasting models, leaning low on purpose.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="strip pin-bottom"><span class="lab">We suggest</span><span><b>{{ n.suggest.total | fm }}</b> for the total company in 2027, {{ n.suggest.total_change | sfm }} above the budget's {{ n.suggest.total_budget | fm }}: raise six café objectives, keep three, add Nautilus, and budget the new cafés on our opening record.</span></div>
  {{ foot(SRC) }}
</section>

{# ================================================================== 3 DIVIDER 1 #}
<section class="page divider">
  <div class="div-left">
    <div class="part">Part 1</div>
    <div class="div-title">The 2026 finish</div>
    <p class="div-sub">With two and a half months to go, how far off can the 2026 estimate be?</p>
    <ul class="div-list">
      <li><span>01</span>{{ "%.0f" | format(t.booked_share * 100) }}% of the year is already booked</li>
      <li><span>02</span>Our forecast for October–December</li>
      <li><span>03</span>Café by café: the budget against our finish</li>
      <li><span>04</span>The only real gap: Nautilus</li>
    </ul>
    <img class="bird" src="assets/parrot-map.png" alt="">
  </div>
  <div class="div-right"><img src="assets/split-order.jpg" alt=""></div>
</section>

{# ================================================================== 4 BOOKED #}
<section class="page">
  {{ head("Part 1 · The 2026 finish") }}
  <h1>{{ "%.0f" | format(t.booked_share * 100) }}% of 2026 is already booked, so the estimate can only move so much</h1>
  <p class="lede">Through October 14, Toast has recorded {{ t.booked | fm }} for the nine existing cafés, {{ "%.0f" | format(t.booked_share * 100) }}% of the budget's {{ t.b26 | fm }} finish. The eleven weeks left would have to miss by 5% to move the year by about 1%.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col" style="flex:1.7">
      <div class="chart-title">2026 net sales by month, nine existing cafés</div>
      <div class="chart-sub">October–December: the budget's estimate (gray) and our forecast (pink marks)</div>
      {{ svg.booked }}
    </div>
    <div class="col" style="flex:1">
      <div class="stat"><div class="lab">Booked, January 1 – October 14</div><div class="val">{{ t.booked | fm }}</div><div class="cap">{{ "%.0f" | format(t.booked_share * 100) }}% of the budget's 2026 finish</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="lab">Still to come, October 15 – December 31</div><div class="val">{{ t.to_come | fm }}</div><div class="cap">about eleven weeks of trading</div></div>
      <div class="stat pinktop"><div class="lab">If those eleven weeks miss by 5%</div><div class="val">±{{ (t.to_come * 0.05) | fm }}</div><div class="cap">±{{ "%.1f" | format(t.to_come * 0.05 / t.b26 * 100) }}% on the year</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="strip pin-bottom"><span class="lab">How it's estimated</span><span>The budget grows each café's October–December 2025 sales at its own Q3 2026 rate ({{ t.b_q3 | pct }} for the nine on the budget's figures). Our own forecast for the quarter, from the same three models we use for 2027, is on the next page.</span></div>
  {{ foot(SRC) }}
</section>

{# ================================================================== 4b OUR Q4 FORECAST #}
{% set Q = n.q4 %}
<section class="page">
  {{ head("Part 1 · The 2026 finish") }}
  <h1>Our own forecast for October–December lands within {{ "%.0f" | format(((Q.ours_total / Q.budget_total - 1) | abs) * 100 + 0.5) }}% of the budget's</h1>
  <p class="lede">We forecast the rest of 2026 with the same three models we use for 2027. For the nine existing cafés they expect {{ Q.ours_total | fm }} in October–December, {{ (Q.ours_total - Q.budget_total) | fk }} ({{ (Q.ours_total / Q.budget_total - 1) | pct }}) {{ "more" if Q.ours_total > Q.budget_total else "less" }} than the budget, and October so far is running slightly ahead of both.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col" style="flex:1.65">
      <div class="chart-title">October–December 2026 by month, nine existing cafés</div>
      <div class="chart-sub">Net sales · whisker: lowest to highest of our three models</div>
      {{ svg.q4 }}
    </div>
    <div class="col" style="flex:1">
      <table class="roomy">
        <thead><tr><th class="l">Oct–Dec</th><th>Net sales</th><th>vs 2025</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Same months, 2025</td><td>{{ Q.ly_total | fm }}</td><td class="dim">—</td></tr>
