    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="strip pin-bottom"><span class="lab">2026 finish</span><span>Our forecast makes the nine cafés' 2026 <b>{{ t.e26 | fm }}</b> (Toast to September plus our October–December), against the budget's {{ t.b26 | fm }}: {{ t.d26 | pct }}. If October's pace ({{ t.oct_g | pct }} on last year) held for the quarter, it would add about {{ (t.q4_oct_pace - t.q4_b) | fk }} to the budget's figure.</span></div>
  {{ foot("Our forecast: blend of Prophet, SARIMA and Holt-Winters fitted through Sep 30, 2026 · " ~ SRC) }}
</section>

{# ================================================================== 5 TABLE #}
<section class="page">
  {{ head("Part 1 · The 2026 finish") }}
