      <div class="callout" style="margin-top:10px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px">The cafés added <b>{{ t.added26 | fm(1) }}</b> in 2026. The budget adds <b>{{ t.added27_b | fm(1) }}</b> in 2027; our plan adds <b class="pink">{{ t.added27_p | fm(1) }}</b>.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{ foot("No-growth estimates: seasonal run-rate of Jul–Sep 2026 sales; and each café's Prophet trend held at its Sep 30, 2026 level") }}
</section>

