        <div class="r tot final"><div class="what">= Our plan 2027: total company</div><div><div class="bar ours" style="width:100%"></div></div><div class="amt">{{ Z.ours | fm }}</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin-top:8px">Adjustment bars at 4× scale. Boulangerie (opens April) has no volume in the budget or here. Growth on 2026: budget {{ (Z.budget / n.budget_total26 - 1) | pct }}, our plan {{ (Z.ours / n.all26 - 1) | pct }} (on each one's 2026 total).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col" style="flex:1">
      <h3>Risks to our plan</h3>
